error_signature: "fatal error: '<dep>.h' file not found|Could NOT find .* with bare find_library in upstream CMakeLists"
root_cause: "上游 CMake 项目（cget 风格）假设依赖装在系统前缀：裸 find_library 定位链接库 + 源码直接 #include 依赖头且不给目标加依赖 include 目录。Conan 依赖在各自包目录，链接定位与头文件定位两条链路同时断。"
rec_approach: "generate() 双注入：tc.variables[CMAKE_LIBRARY_PATH]=各依赖 cpp_info.libdirs 分号串（find_library 命中）；tc.extra_cxxflags 逐个 -I 各依赖 includedirs（头文件命中）。勿覆盖 CMAKE_CXX_FLAGS（冲掉工具链 flags）。"
match_keywords: ["find_library", "lzma.h", "file not found", "CMAKE_LIBRARY_PATH", "extra_cxxflags", "cget", "上游测试编译失败"]
error_excerpt: "include/shrinkwrap/xz.hpp:8:10: fatal error: 'lzma.h' file not found"
severity: P2
category: conan
last_updated: 2026-09-27
